# Downloaded third-party runtimes. Restore them locally with:
#   powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\tools\setup_windows_dependencies.ps1
# Keeping them out of Git keeps the public repository source-focused and avoids
# redistributing copied GPL/LGPL object code as part of the source checkout.
